WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.820
Abraham, whom the Qur'an
calls a friend of God.

2
00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:07.750
Moses, to whom, it says, God spoke direct.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.130
Jesus, whom it calls God's
Word, and a spirit from Him.

4
00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:15.090
Muslims honour all three as prophets.

5
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.100
Yet the Qur'an gives
Muhammad a different title:

6
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.130
the Seal of the Prophets.

7
00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:23.090
Why would anyone call a prophet a seal?

8
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:28.050
In this mission, you'll see how Muslims
follow his example in daily life today.

9
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.750
Then you'll read the verse
that gives him the title,

10
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.650
and work out what it means.

11
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:37.640
Your mission: find out what Muslims
mean when they call Muhammad a seal.
